From 71994dae19a446f8fcad3bfea2d0f72f24bf1794 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Andr=C3=A9=20Machado?= <machaddr@falanet.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 17:28:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 52/53] riscv: dts: starfive: add Pine64 PineTab-V

Add the common PineTab-V hardware description and dated revision DTs.
Describe regulators, storage, PCIe/NVMe, USB, radios, keys, RTC, touch,
panel, PWM backlight, charger, battery, cameras, GPU, audio, and the
revision-specific wiring.

The electrical mapping follows both released PINE64 schematics and
retains the StarFive vendor source copyright and dual license. Features
without a current upstream implementation remain disabled or explicitly
experimental.

Link: https://files.pine64.org/doc/PineTab/PineTab-V_Schematic_Ver1-20230614.pdf
Link: https://files.pine64.org/doc/PineTab/PineTab-V_Schematic_Ver2-20240730.pdf
Link: https://github.com/starfive-tech/linux/tree/pinetab-v1.3.0
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
